<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">How to inject knowledge efficiently? Knowledge Infusion Scaling Law 
<br class="ltx_break">for Pre-training Large Language Models</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
